sentences.text:
The petitioner is directed to be enlarged on bail in S.C.No.84/2023 arising out of Crime No.56/2023 of Balaganoor Police Station, Raichur district, registered for the offences punishable under Sections 498, 302 and 504 of IPC, pending on the file of learned III Additional District and Sessions Judge, Raichur, subject to the following conditions:
NC: 2024:KHC-K:3513 a) The petitioner shall execute personal bond for a sum of Rs.1,00,000/- with two sureties for the likesum, to the satisfaction of the jurisdictional Court;
b) The petitioner shall appear regularly on all the dates of hearing before the Trial Court unless the Trial Court exempts his appearance for valid reasons;
c) The petitioner shall not directly or indirectly threaten or tamper with the prosecution witnesses;
d) The petitioner shall not involve in similar offences in future;
e) The petitioner shall not leave the jurisdiction of the Trial Court without permission of the said Court until the case registered against him is disposed off.
Sd/-
